\cf0 2. Backend Services Comparison\
What They SHARE (The Brain & Business Core):\
Both voice channels share the exact same intelligence and operational backend:\
\
The Reasoning Engine (LLM): Gemini 2.0 / Claude 3.5 / GPT-4o configured with the HVAC dispatch persona (qualifying the emergency, extracting address, checking tech on-call status).\
Function Calling & Tools: The exact same API endpoints to book Marcus, Dave, or Elena into the dispatch database and update the Owner Control Panel in real-time.\
Domain Knowledge Base: Same equipment specs, after-hours diagnostic prompts, and emergency pricing tiers.\
What is DIFFERENT (The Ingestion & Pipeline):\
A. Call Voice Dispatch (Telephony Stack)\
Telephony Carrier / SIP Provider: Twilio Voice, Telnyx, or SignalWire.\
Owns the phone number (202) 618-1204 and handles carrier handoffs from Verizon/AT&T/T-Mobile.\
Audio Bridge: Twilio Bi-directional Media Streams (WebSockets streaming base64 8kHz \uc0\u956 -law audio).\
Voice Pipeline:\
Option 1 (Modular): Twilio Stream $\\rightarrow$ Deepgram (Streaming STT) $\\rightarrow$ Backend Agent $\\rightarrow$ Cartesia / ElevenLabs (TTS) $\\rightarrow$ Twilio audio response.\
Option 2 (Direct Multimodal): Twilio Stream $\\rightarrow$ Gemini 2.0 Multimodal Live WebSocket (native audio in/out) $\\rightarrow$ Twilio.\
B. Voice Avatar (Browser WebRTC / Web Audio Stack)\
Audio Capture: Browser Web Audio API (navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia) capturing microphone PCM chunks directly.\
Transport: Direct secure WebSocket (wss://) or LiveKit / Agora WebRTC channel between the browser client and your Cloud Run backend.\
Audio & Visual Pipeline:\
Browser mic $\\rightarrow$ Gemini 2.0 Flash Multimodal Live API or OpenAI Realtime API.\
Audio streams back to the browser's AudioContext to play through device speakers with sub-300ms latency.\
Visual Layer: Audio amplitude frequencies drive the Canvas waveform visualizer, or stream video frames from an avatar engine (such as Tavus, HeyGen, or a custom Canvas sprite).\
Summary Takeaway\
Call Voice Dispatch proves to HVAC business owners that your AI can replace their after-hours call center and answer real phone calls on the 1st ring.\
Voice Avatar is an on-page interactive showcase that lets users test the AI's conversational speed instantly right inside the browser without picking up a phone.}